1
00:00:00,264 --> 00:00:02,224
Would you like a chocolate?

2
00:00:02,391 --> 00:00:04,851
(Penny:)Um, yeah, sure.

3
00:00:07,354 --> 00:00:08,854
(Penny:)Thanks.

4
00:00:11,275 --> 00:00:13,235
(Leonard:)What was that?

5
00:00:14,152 --> 00:00:15,692
(Sheldon:)You said be nice to Penny.

6
00:00:15,862 --> 00:00:20,032
(Sheldon:)I believe offering chocolate to someone
falls within the definition of "nice."

7
00:00:20,367 --> 00:00:24,157
(Leonard:)It does. But in my experience, you don't.

8
00:00:25,289 --> 00:00:27,709
(Sheldon:)There are more things in heaven
and Earth, Horatio...

9
00:00:27,874 --> 00:00:29,794
(Sheldon:)...than are dreamt of in your philosophy.

10
00:00:29,960 --> 00:00:33,670
(Leonard:)Yeah, now, that's you.
Obnoxious and insufferable.

11
00:00:40,512 --> 00:00:42,972
(Howard(arriving, in goth gear):)What's going on, day dwellers?

12
00:00:43,348 --> 00:00:47,898
(Penny:)Oh, man, did the KISS Army repeal
"Don't ask, don't tell"?

13
00:00:48,312 --> 00:00:52,352
No. Raj and I are going to a goth club
in Hollywood...

14
00:00:52,524 --> 00:00:54,524
(Howard:)...to hang with the night people.

15
00:00:55,902 --> 00:00:56,902
Wanna come along?

16
00:00:57,070 --> 00:00:59,530
(Penny:)Oh, wow, you're actually going out
like that?

